        "BODY": "Crypto analyst {x} (@unknowDLT) has drawn parallels between XRP’s current market structure and a significant price movement from October 2024. According to his analysis, the asset’s recent decline and rapid rebound mirror a pattern that previously led to an 800% surge. His attached chart highlights the correction of nearly 27% followed by a sharp recovery, suggesting that XRP could be entering a similar phase once again. The analyst noted that in October last year, XRP experienced a substantial shakeout before beginning a strong upward trend. He believes this current setup reflects that same sequence, but with the potential for a different magnitude of results due to current market catalysts. In October last year, the price of XRP did exactly what it is doing now. A big shakeout followed by a sudden rise (+800%) But this time the sudden rise will be different, coinciding with ETFs (supply shock) and the implementation of ISO20022 (probable DLT adoption). pic.twitter.com/2l6qBSvNi0 — {x} (@unknowDLT) October 17, 2025 Catalysts Driving the Potential Move Unlike the previous rally, the analyst pointed out that this period may align with two major developments: the anticipated launch of exchange-traded funds (ETFs) on October 24 and the full implementation of the ISO 20022 financial messaging standard on November 22. He described these events as potential triggers for a supply shock and accelerated distributed ledger technology (DLT) adoption, which could amplify XRP’s market movement. The chart he shared shows XRP rebounding sharply from the $0.48 level after the correction, climbing above $0.60 within a short period. This upward move forms the technical foundation for his projection that the current cycle could replicate or even surpass the previous one. We are on X, follow us to connect with us :- @TimesTabloid1 — TimesTabloid (@TimesTabloid1) June 15, 2025 Community Insights and Reactions Other analysts and traders joined the discussion to expand on this thesis. X user Crypto Dog commented that last year’s October correction served as the foundation for the 800% surge and suggested that the conditions this time are even more favorable. He pointed to the timing of the ETF release and the ISO 20022 activation as critical elements that could accelerate adoption and demand. He concluded that these factors could position Ripple’s ecosystem to redefine digital payment infrastructure within Web3. Another user, Brandon, referenced XRP’s historical structure from 2017, arguing that the current macroeconomic backdrop and institutional readiness make the setup fundamentally stronger. He emphasized that the broader infrastructure is now capable of absorbing institutional capital flow, making this market phase structurally distinct from prior cycles. The convergence of these technical and fundamental indicators has led several analysts to anticipate significant volatility in the coming weeks. If ETF approvals coincide with ISO 20022’s global rollout, XRP could experience accelerated market participation and renewed institutional interest. Disclaimer : This content is meant to inform and should not be considered financial advice. The views expressed in this article may include the author’s personal opinions and do not represent Times Tabloid’s opinion. Readers are advised to conduct thorough research before making any investment decisions. Any action taken by the reader is strictly at their own risk. Times Tabloid is not responsible for any financial losses. Follow us on X , Facebook , Telegram , and Google News The post Analyst to XRP Holders: A Big Shakeout and Sudden 800% Rise. Something Big Is Coming appeared first on Times Tabloid .",
